{"text": "At last she took out one match and struck it on the wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The match burned with a bright flame, like a tiny candle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly she seemed to be sitting in front of a big iron stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fire was burning brightly, and it was so warm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stretched out her feet to warm them, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the flame went out, and the stove was gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She struck another match, and the wall became as thin as a veil. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She could see into a room with a big table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the white table, there was a roast goose stuffed with apples and plums. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the goose jumped down and walked toward the girl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the match went out, and there was only the cold wall.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "t", "r", "u", "c", "k", " ", "i", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "t", "c", "h", " ", "b", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "f", "l", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "n", "y", " ", "c", "a", "n", "d", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "e", "e", "m", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "n", " ", "f", "r", "o", "n", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "i", "r", "o", "n", " ", "s", "t"